      "block_id": "2605.24807_p11_b47",
      "text": "SemiVL [12]\nYes\nNo\nCLIP-Base\n88M\n50.1\n52.8\n53.6\n55.4\n56.5\n33.7\n35.1\n37.2\n39.4\n\u2013\n84.0\n85.6\n86.0\n86.7\n87.3\nUniMatchV2 [37]\nYes\nNo\nDINOv2-B\n97.5M\n47.9\n55.8\n58.7\n60.4\n63.3\n38.7\n45.0\n46.7\n49.8\n52.0\n86.3\n87.9 88.9 90.0\n90.8\nUniMatchV2 [37] (labelled-only)\nNo\nNo\nDINOv2-B\n97.5M\n36.8\n45.8\n52.1\n56.2\n59.5\n26.1\n39.3\n42.8\n46.4\n49.0\n76.9\n82.1\n85.3\n87.2\n88.3\nOur Method (labelled-only)\nNo\nYes\nCLIP-B+SAM-B 197M\n60.5\n63.2\n65.8\n67.7\n69.2\n47.9\n51.6\n55.2\n57.7\n61.1\n78.3\n81.7\n82.9\n83.9\n85.0\n",
